<title>SLOVENIA: ALPINE SKIING-PANZANINI WINS WOMEN'S GIANT SLALOM.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-PANZANINI WINS WOMEN'S GIANT SLALOM.</headline>
<dateline>MARIBOR, Slovenia 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sabina Panzanini of Italy won a women's Alpine ski World Cup giant slalom race on Friday, in a time of two minutes 34.74 seconds, according to provisional results.  </p>
<p>Her compatriot Deborah Compagnoni shared second place with Austrian Anita Wachter in 2:34.82.</p>
